  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鬼泣武器融入现代Minecraft！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/dmcnew.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;武器：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/meleeweapons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/rangedweapons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"500\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>获取方法：</strong></h3>\n<p>你现在可以在矿井、要塞、沙漠金字塔、丛林神庙、水下废墟和村庄铁匠铺的战利品箱中随机找到所有武器。但它们相当稀有。<br>此外，除了Dr.Faust外，你都可以合成它们。Dr.Faust仅可从创造模式菜单中获得。</p>\n<p>所有配方见下方</p>\n<p><strong><strong>配方：</strong></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/yamatorecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/redqueenrecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/devilswordspardarecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/devilsworddanterecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/rebellionrecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/coyotearecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/ivoryrecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/ebonyrecipe.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/blueroserecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/kalinaann1recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://redboltmedia.github.io/storage/mods/dmcweapons/images/kalinaann2recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"240\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">加入Discord分享你的体验、问题或关于鬼泣武器：重生的想法&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xReJfktHS2\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/911360639035932732/embed.png?style=banner3\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>鬼泣武器：重生最初是作为AzureDoomC制作的‘鬼泣武器’的移植版，你可以在<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/devil-may-cry-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>找到它。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>*所有权利归其各自所有者所有*</em></p>",
